      "comment": "SIMPLY FRIENDS (1) jumps from the inside draw. Latest effort finished 6th in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 on August 19 over 350m at Healesville behind Bravado beaten 4 lengths (20.19). Looks suited and should go close. HOT ROCKER (2) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing sixth (20.67) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning three races. In the mix. DYNAMITE DOUG (8) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 1.75 lengths into second (20.46) at this track in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 over 350m. Racing well and deserves a win. TWO BAYS (7) is worth including.",
